<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>ChatGPT Prompts</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the prompt used for our gpt-3.5-turbo experiments, see Figure <a href="#A7.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ Appendix G ChatGPT Prompts ‣ AVeriTeC: A Dataset for Real-world Claim Verification with Evidence from the Web" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F6" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A7.F6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="121.71" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 121.71" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,121.71) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 121.71 L 477.38 121.71 L 477.38 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 120.33 L 475.99 120.33 L 475.99 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 15.89)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.46em;--ltx-fo-height:6.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="95.32" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 92.63)" width="435.32"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A7.F6.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.46em;">
<span id="A7.F6.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F6.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Can you fact-check a claim for me? Classify the given claim into four labels: "true", "false", "not enough evidence" or "conflicting evidence/cherrypicking". Let’s think step by step. Provide justification before giving the label. Given claim:
