</figure>
</section>
<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Additional Results</h2>

<section id="A8.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">H.1 </span>Claim type</h3>

<div id="A8.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We computed baseline performance in terms of veracity at different evidence thresholds for each claim type. Results can be seen in Table <a href="#A8.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ H.1 Claim type ‣ Appendix H Additional Results ‣ AVeriTeC: A Dataset for Real-world Claim Verification with Evidence from the Web" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> below:</p>
</div>
